135 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 73 0 R
/E (At the beginning of the challenge, the robot is placed on the designated START square. The arena contains Green markers, which indicate the valid route to the destination, and Red markers, which represent restricted areas that the robot must never enter. In addition, one or more obstacles will be placed at random positions along the route, requiring the robot to detect and safely navigate around them while continuing toward its destination.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
136 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 73 0 R
/E (The robot must autonomously identify the correct path by recognizing the Green markers and make real-time navigation decisions throughout the mission. It is not permitted to follow or move onto any Red-marked square. If an obstacle blocks the intended route, the robot must detect its presence, determine an alternative safe path, and continue its journey without human intervention.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
